		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I wake up as usual.
text I think I was having a dream.
text At least, it feels like I was having a dream.
text The first thing I think about is how I'll be having a date with Kotomi today.
text I was so worked up about it yesterday, but I'm much calmer this morning.
text It might be because I met that gentleman yesterday.
text I look at the clock.
text There's still some time before we're set to meet, but there's no point in killing time at home.
text @[Tomoya]
text (I can just eat breakfast on the way there...)
text I get out of bed.
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s4
fi
goto 5
label s4
setvar strS[1000] = ""
